BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mva-2026-data-deletion@tfius
DTSTAMP:20260829T001500Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:MVA Hackathon — DELETE challenge data and notify Sage Bionetworks
DESCRIPTION:Obligation accepted when requesting dataset access\, not a suggestion.\n\n
  1. Delete the challenge data:\n     rm -rf /mnt/data/mva-hackathon-2026/data\n
  2. Delete derived files containing patient sequence:\n     rm -rf /mnt/data/mva-hackathon-2026/work/align\n
  3. Email MVAHackathon2026@synapse.org confirming deletion from all personal
  compute environments.\n\nKeep: code\, reports and journals — those are the
  research output\, released CC BY 4.0. Delete: FASTQ\, VCF\, BAM\, the clinical
  phenotype document\, and anything derived that carries the sequence itself.\n\n
  Roughly 85 GB of challenge data plus ~150 GB of derived BAM and reference under
  /mnt/data/mva-hackathon-2026/.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-P1D
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: delete MVA challenge data and email MVAHackathon2026@synapse.org
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:PT9H
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Delete MVA challenge data now and email MVAHackathon2026@synapse.org
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mva-2026-record-video@tfius
DTSTAMP:20260829T003000Z
DTSTART:20261010T100000Z
DTEND:20261010T120000Z
SUMMARY:Record MVA Hackathon Track 2 pitch video
DESCRIPTION:The real deadline\, two weeks before submissions close.\n\nTrack 2 accepts
  ONE submission and the pitch-video URL is hard-validated — no public video\, no
  submission\, no second attempt.\n\nScript: reports/track2-video-script.md in
  github.com/tfius/mva-hackathon-2026 — 486 spoken words\, 3:02 at 160 wpm\, with
  per-section word budgets.\n\nThen upload to YouTube or Vimeo (must be publicly
  viewable) and submit with:\n  Team name: texdata\n  GitHub:
  https://github.com/tfius/mva-hackathon-2026\n  Report:
  reports/track2-mechanism-and-repurposing.md\n  Video URL: the link\n  Notes
  (optional\, but use it): Track 1 scored a confirmed full match at rank 1\, so the
  mechanism chain reasons from a verified genotype.
LOCATION:https://sagebio-rare-disease-real-kid-mva-hackathon-2026.hf.space/
